WEBVTT

00:14.189 --> 00:15.844
Ah.
啊。

00:15.844 --> 00:18.913
Ahh.
啊。

00:18.913 --> 00:20.637
I always make lots of money
我总是赚很多钱

00:20.637 --> 00:23.016
when the morning air smells
this good.
当早晨的空气散发出气味时
这很好。

00:27.085 --> 00:28.637
Huh?
啊？

00:28.637 --> 00:29.879
Hmm.
唔。

00:31.016 --> 00:33.948
What in
Finnegan's Footlocker?
什么在
芬尼根的储物柜？

00:36.672 --> 00:40.051
Looks like Plankton
is moving away, Mr. K.
看起来像浮游生物
正在搬走，K 先生。

00:40.051 --> 00:41.741
Yeah, right.
是的，对。

00:41.741 --> 00:43.913
He's planning something.
他正在计划一些事情。

00:43.913 --> 00:45.534
Well, Eugene--
嗯，尤金——

00:45.534 --> 00:47.361
I'm leaving for good.
我要永远离开了

00:47.361 --> 00:49.913
Karen and I are gonna travel
the world
凯伦和我要去旅行
世界

00:49.913 --> 00:51.637
before I take it over.
在我接管之前。

00:51.637 --> 00:55.154
Yeah, right.
是的，对。

00:55.154 --> 00:56.948
Right, okay.
对了，好吧。

00:56.948 --> 00:58.534
Bye-bye, then.
那么，再见。

00:58.534 --> 01:01.982
I'll see you later, kid.
稍后再见，孩子。

01:07.603 --> 01:09.499
You're still here, but I--
你还在这里，但我——

01:09.499 --> 01:11.430
I already miss you!
我已经想念你了！

01:11.430 --> 01:13.913
<i>All right, that's enough.
Let's go.</i>
<i>好吧，够了。
我们走吧。</i>

01:17.844 --> 01:20.775
Farewell,
Krabby Patty secret formula.
再见，
蟹黄派秘方。

01:20.775 --> 01:23.672
<i>Mwah.</i>
Farewell, Bikini Bottom.
<i>哇。</i>
再见，比基尼泳裤。

01:25.844 --> 01:27.154
Yeah, right.
是的，对。

01:27.154 --> 01:28.361
Hmm?
唔？

01:37.637 --> 01:39.603
Wait a minute.
等一下。

01:43.120 --> 01:47.016
Yahoo!
雅虎！

01:47.016 --> 01:50.016
I'm free!
我自由了！

01:50.016 --> 01:53.396
Yeah, baby.
是的，宝贝。

01:53.396 --> 01:55.396
I'm free. I'm free.
我有空了。我有空了。

01:55.396 --> 01:57.016
No more Plankton, me free.
不再有浮游生物，我自由了。

01:57.016 --> 01:58.499
Free, free, free, free, free.
免费，免费，免费，免费，免费。

01:58.499 --> 02:00.327
both: Free, free, free, free.
两者：免费，免费，免费，免费。

02:01.810 --> 02:03.258
No more Plankton, huh?
不再有浮游生物了，是吗？

02:03.258 --> 02:05.534
Uh, Mr. Krabs?
呃，蟹老板？

02:05.534 --> 02:07.879
What is it, boy-o?
这是什么，男孩？

02:16.603 --> 02:18.499
- Huh?
- Wow.
- 啊？
- 哇。

02:27.292 --> 02:29.396
FlowerPot Florist?
花盆花店？

02:29.396 --> 02:31.913
Oh, I just love
floral arrangements
哦，我就是喜欢
插花

02:31.913 --> 02:33.499
at affordable prices.
以实惠的价格。

02:33.499 --> 02:35.775
Well, I'd better make friends
with the owner right away.
嗯，我最好交个朋友
立即与业主。

02:35.775 --> 02:39.637
I don't want another crazy feud
with him too.
我不想再次发生疯狂的争执
也和他在一起。

02:39.637 --> 02:40.948
Hello.
你好。

02:44.568 --> 02:47.810
Oh, welcome
to the FlowerPot, huh?
噢，欢迎
去花盆吧？

02:47.810 --> 02:50.913
I'm the owner, Petunia.
- Well, I'm Mr.--
我是主人，佩妮。
- 嗯，我是先生--

02:50.913 --> 02:53.223
Oh, you don't have
to tell me who you are.
哦，你没有
告诉我你是谁。

02:53.223 --> 02:55.361
You're Mr. Krab, huh?
你是蟹老板吧？

02:55.361 --> 02:57.292
And you run the Krusty Krab, huh?
你经营蟹堡王吧？

02:57.292 --> 02:59.741
It's my favorite restaurant, huh?
这是我最喜欢的餐厅，对吧？

02:59.741 --> 03:02.913
Well, nice to meet you, Petunia.
嗯，很高兴认识你，佩妮。

03:02.913 --> 03:04.465
I just wanted to stop by
我只是想顺便过来一下

03:04.465 --> 03:06.327
and welcome you
to the neighborhood.
欢迎您
到附近。

03:06.327 --> 03:09.120
You stop by any time, huh?
你随时过来吧？

03:09.120 --> 03:11.879
Well, thank ye.
嗯，谢谢你们。

03:13.396 --> 03:15.913
What a nice lady.
多么好的一位女士啊。

03:18.292 --> 03:21.948
<i>Krabs is actually buying it.</i>
<i>螃蟹实际上正在购买它。</i>

03:21.948 --> 03:26.603
I know, huh?
我知道，嗯？

03:26.603 --> 03:29.534
This friendly florist farce
will finally get
这场友善的花店闹剧
最终会得到

03:29.534 --> 03:31.913
that Krabby Patty
secret formula.
那个蟹蟹帕蒂
秘密配方。

03:34.568 --> 03:37.051
- Huh?
- Hello, new neighbor.
- 啊？
- 你好，新邻居。

03:37.051 --> 03:38.775
Whoa!
哇！

03:39.741 --> 03:41.361
Wow!
哇！

03:41.361 --> 03:44.534
I like your flowers.
我喜欢你的花。

03:44.534 --> 03:45.672
I get it.
我得到它。

03:45.672 --> 03:47.499
Sometimes you just gotta stop
有时你必须停下来

03:47.499 --> 03:51.051
and smell the snapdragons, huh?
闻一下金鱼草的味道，嗯？

03:53.430 --> 03:55.154
Whee.
呼。

03:55.154 --> 03:56.430
Ooh!
哦！

03:58.430 --> 04:00.982
I wanna buy this big one!
我想买这么大的！

04:00.982 --> 04:03.327
- That one's not for sale...
<i>- Aah!</i>
- 那是非卖品...
<i>-啊啊！</i>

04:03.327 --> 04:05.361
But you can have
this one for free.
但你可以拥有
这个是免费的。

04:05.361 --> 04:06.292
Huh?
啊？

04:06.292 --> 04:08.430
Mmm.
嗯。

04:08.430 --> 04:10.913
Whoa!
哇！

04:10.913 --> 04:12.637
Ow!
噢！

04:14.120 --> 04:16.810
SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝...

04:16.810 --> 04:18.637
get back to your grill.
回到你的烤架上。

04:18.637 --> 04:21.844
I've got orders coming out
of my nose.
我有订单发出
我的鼻子。

04:23.534 --> 04:25.465
Aye-aye, sir.
是的，先生。

04:25.465 --> 04:27.258
And bye-bye, ma'am.
再见，女士。

04:30.361 --> 04:32.775
Sorry about that, miss.
抱歉，小姐。

04:32.775 --> 04:35.327
SpongeBob can be a real pain
in the--
海绵宝宝可能真的很痛苦
在——

04:35.327 --> 04:37.741
Huh?
啊？

04:37.741 --> 04:40.603
Petunia.
矮牵牛。

04:40.603 --> 04:42.430
Enchanté.
迷人。

04:42.430 --> 04:44.982
Je suis Squidward.
我就是章鱼哥。

04:44.982 --> 04:48.948
If you ever need any help
arranging your flowers,
如果您需要任何帮助
布置你的鲜花，

04:48.948 --> 04:50.706
give me a holler.
给我喊一声。

04:50.706 --> 04:54.637
Think of me
as your "Pogonia Pappy."
想我吧
作为你的“Pogonia Pappy”。

04:54.637 --> 04:56.499
Here's
a complimentary carnation
这是
赠送康乃馨

04:56.499 --> 04:59.085
for "Pogonia Pappy," huh?
为“Pogonia Pappy”，嗯？

04:59.085 --> 05:00.327
Uh-huh, aha.
嗯嗯，哈哈。

05:00.327 --> 05:02.292
Ha.
哈。

05:02.292 --> 05:03.982
Huh?
啊？

05:03.982 --> 05:06.016
Agh, look away!
啊啊，看开吧！

05:06.016 --> 05:07.913
I'm hideous!
我真丑！

05:10.775 --> 05:14.258
Yeesh.
This disguise is dangerous.
是啊。
这种伪装很危险。

05:16.741 --> 05:19.948
Enjoy the daffodils, huh?
欣赏水仙花吧？

05:21.603 --> 05:25.016
No one suspects a thing.
没有人怀疑一件事。

05:25.016 --> 05:26.568
<i>So are you ready</i>
<i>你准备好了吗</i>

05:26.568 --> 05:30.465
<i>for Faux Florist phase two,
Petunia?</i>
<i>对于人造花店第二阶段，
矮牵牛？</i>

05:30.465 --> 05:32.051
Soon, my dear.
很快，亲爱的。

05:32.051 --> 05:34.844
All in good time.
一切都恰逢其时。

05:34.844 --> 05:37.499
But isn't
this arrangement fabulous?
但不是
这个安排棒极了？

05:37.499 --> 05:39.085
Oh!
哦！

05:39.085 --> 05:41.568
Time to make a delivery.
是时候送货了。

05:44.430 --> 05:46.120
Power to the flower.
为花提供力量。

05:47.223 --> 05:49.327
<i>Huh?</i>
<i>嗯？</i>

05:53.637 --> 05:58.016
- Wow!
- Hooray!
- 哇！
- 万岁！

05:58.016 --> 06:00.396
Oh.
哦。

06:00.396 --> 06:01.844
Huh?
啊？

06:07.223 --> 06:08.603
Don't pick your nose.
不要挖鼻孔。

06:08.603 --> 06:11.223
Pick a flower.
选一朵花。

06:15.154 --> 06:18.223
Oh, isn't this lovely?
哦，这不是很可爱吗？

06:18.223 --> 06:20.327
Enjoy. Bye now.
享受。再见了。

06:20.327 --> 06:22.465
Power to the flower.
为花提供力量。

06:22.465 --> 06:24.844
Bonjour, Petunia.
你好，佩妮。

06:24.844 --> 06:28.292
I would like to buy a bouquet.
我想买一束花。

06:28.292 --> 06:29.913
Back again, huh?
又回来了吧？

06:29.913 --> 06:31.982
You'd better cut back,
Mr. Tentacles.
你最好减少一点
触手先生。

06:31.982 --> 06:34.603
This is your fourth bouquet today.
这是你今天的第四束花。

06:34.603 --> 06:38.534
Well, uh--
嗯，呃——

06:38.534 --> 06:40.741
- Mr. Squidward?
- Huh?
- 章鱼哥先生？
- 啊？

06:40.741 --> 06:43.223
Back to work.
返回工作岗位。

06:44.568 --> 06:46.465
Mr. Krabs...
蟹老板...

06:46.465 --> 06:49.016
- Hmm?
- You'll save me a trip.
- 唔？
- 你会帮我省去一次旅行。

06:49.016 --> 06:52.327
Your Krusty Krab bouquets
are ready, huh?
您的蟹堡王花束
准备好了吗？

06:52.327 --> 06:54.154
Ooh.
哦。

06:54.154 --> 06:56.534
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

06:56.534 --> 06:57.982
Carry that bag.
拎着那个包。

06:57.982 --> 07:00.154
Yes, sir, sir.
是的，先生，先生。

07:02.741 --> 07:04.361
Whoa. I got it.
哇哦。我得到了它。

07:04.361 --> 07:07.120
Oh, whoop.
哦，哎呀。

07:07.120 --> 07:10.879
Oh, thank you, Petunia.
哦，谢谢你，佩妮。

07:10.879 --> 07:14.499
Smell you later!
稍后闻你！

07:14.499 --> 07:16.327
<i>You did it, Sheldon.</i>
<i>你做到了，谢尔顿。</i>

07:16.327 --> 07:20.879
<i>The Krusty Krab will be
festooned with our flowers.</i>
<i>蟹堡王将是
装饰着我们的鲜花。</i>

07:20.879 --> 07:24.327
<i>Soon we will have
their formula.</i>
<i>很快我们就会有
他们的公式。</i>

07:24.327 --> 07:27.051
Well,
I don't know about that.
嗯，
我对此一无所知。

07:27.051 --> 07:29.189
<i>- Huh?</i>
- Actually, I was thinking
<i>- 嗯？</i>
- 其实我在想

07:29.189 --> 07:31.292
of putting my plan on hold
for a while.
搁置我的计划
有一段时间了。

07:31.292 --> 07:32.499
<i>What?</i>
<i>什么？</i>

07:32.499 --> 07:35.396
And becoming
a full-time florist.
并成为
一名全职花店。

07:35.396 --> 07:37.603
I love making customers smile,
我喜欢让顾客微笑，

07:37.603 --> 07:41.154
and I really think I have
the knack for flower arranging.
我真的认为我有
插花的技巧。

07:41.154 --> 07:42.396
Boom.
繁荣。

07:42.396 --> 07:44.810
<i>Aw, that's so sweet.</i>
<i>哇，太可爱了。</i>

07:44.810 --> 07:48.430
<i>My widdle man wants
to be a fworist.</i>
<i>我的中间人想要
成为一名 fworist。</i>

07:48.430 --> 07:50.120
It's my new dream.
这是我的新梦想。

07:50.120 --> 07:53.016
<i>Enjoy that dream
while you can, honey.</i>
<i>享受那个梦想
只要你可以，亲爱的。</i>

07:53.016 --> 07:55.982
<i>You got about five minutes.</i>
- What do you mean?
<i>你大约有五分钟的时间。</i>
- 你什么意思？

07:55.982 --> 07:58.913
<i>Don't you remember
your plan?</i>
<i>你不记得了吗
你的计划？</i>

07:58.913 --> 08:01.154
<i>You sell exploding flowers
to Krabs,</i>
<i>你卖爆炸花
蟹蟹，</i>

08:01.154 --> 08:02.844
<i>wait for the timers to go off,</i>
<i>等待计时器响起，</i>

08:02.844 --> 08:04.879
<i>and while everyone
is freaking out,</i>
<i>虽然每个人
吓坏了，</i>

08:04.879 --> 08:09.982
<i>you walk right in
and take the formula.</i>
<i>你走进去
并采用公式。</i>

08:09.982 --> 08:13.085
Neptune's nose hairs,
I forgot!
海王星的鼻毛，
我忘了！

08:13.085 --> 08:15.534
I've gotta stop those flowers
from blooming
我得阻止那些花
从开花

08:15.534 --> 08:17.706
and save my new career.
并拯救我的新事业。

08:17.706 --> 08:19.741
Huh?
啊？

08:22.810 --> 08:25.948
Ah, Petunia.
啊，佩妮。

08:25.948 --> 08:27.879
Look how your beautiful flowers
看看你的花多么美丽

08:27.879 --> 08:29.982
have brightened up
the Krusty Krab.
已经变亮了
蟹堡王。

08:29.982 --> 08:31.706
That's great, Eugene.
Huh!
太好了，尤金。
哈！

08:31.706 --> 08:33.637
- Whoa!
- Pardon me, huh?
- 哇！
- 请原谅我，嗯？

08:33.637 --> 08:35.810
Pardon me, huh?
Pardon me, huh?
原谅我吧？
原谅我吧？

08:35.810 --> 08:41.361
Pardon me, huh?
原谅我吧？

08:41.361 --> 08:43.396
Don't forget this.
别忘了这一点。

08:43.396 --> 08:44.982
I'll just freshen
these florets
我就清新一下
这些小花

08:44.982 --> 08:49.016
and bring them right back, huh?
然后把他们带回来，嗯？

08:49.016 --> 08:50.948
I wonder what's wrong
with Petunia.
我想知道怎么了
与佩妮。

08:50.948 --> 08:53.603
Huh? Nothing's wrong
with her.
啊？没什么问题
和她在一起。

08:53.603 --> 08:56.982
She's a perfectionist like me.
她和我一样是个完美主义者。

08:56.982 --> 08:58.775
I'm in love with her,
我爱上了她，

08:58.775 --> 09:03.120
and I can't keep it a secret
any longer!
我无法保守秘密
不再这样了！

09:03.120 --> 09:05.879
Petunia!
矮牵牛！

09:05.879 --> 09:08.603
I've got exactly one minute
我只有一分钟的时间

09:08.603 --> 09:10.465
to defuse these bombs.
来拆除这些炸弹。

09:12.534 --> 09:17.637
I picked this begonia
from my own flower garden, huh?
我摘了这个海棠
来自我自己的花园，是吧？

09:17.637 --> 09:19.879
Oh, that's a nice one,
哦，那是一个不错的，

09:19.879 --> 09:21.775
but I can't right now,
Mr. Tentacles.
但我现在不能
触手先生。

09:21.775 --> 09:24.085
Please step aside.
请靠边站。

09:24.085 --> 09:28.568
Petunia the florist,
花店矮牵牛，

09:28.568 --> 09:30.810
will you marry--
你会结婚吗——

09:30.810 --> 09:33.948
huh?
嗯？

09:33.948 --> 09:36.706
You loopy lovesick lummox.
你这个疯狂的相思病笨蛋。

09:36.706 --> 09:39.810
You sabotaged my whole plan!
你破坏了我的整个计划！

09:50.913 --> 09:52.844
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

09:52.844 --> 09:56.465
Not only did you play
with Squidward's heart,
你不仅玩过
带着章鱼哥的心，

09:56.465 --> 09:59.189
but you cost me 24 bouquets.
但你却让我损失了 24 束花。

09:59.189 --> 10:02.534
I say we step on him!
我说我们踩他！

10:02.534 --> 10:04.706
Whoopsie daisy, huh?
哎哟雏菊，是吗？

10:04.706 --> 10:08.189
Huh?
啊？

10:09.982 --> 10:11.810
Petunia was very nice,
佩妮非常好，

10:11.810 --> 10:14.672
but I'm so glad you're back, Plankton.
但我很高兴你回来了，浮游生物。

10:14.672 --> 10:16.223
Thanks, SpongeBoob.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

10:16.223 --> 10:19.879
You've given me the greatest
gift I could ever ask for:
你给了我最伟大的
我可以要求的礼物：

10:19.879 --> 10:22.430
just enough time to do this.
刚好有足够的时间来做这件事。

10:28.637 --> 10:30.361
<i>Let's go, buttercup.</i>
<i>我们走吧，毛茛。</i>

10:30.361 --> 10:31.844
Toodle-oo!
嘟嘟哦！

10:31.844 --> 10:36.499
No more flowers.
不再有花了。

10:36.499 --> 10:39.361
It's back
to the secret formula for me.
回来了
给我的秘密配方。

10:40.810 --> 10:42.844
<i>My iris!</i>
<i>我的虹膜！</i>

10:45.534 --> 10:47.948
Oh, no.
哦，不。

10:47.948 --> 10:50.465
- Aah!
- Whoa!
- 啊啊！
- 哇！

10:50.465 --> 10:54.120
I'm back, baby!
我回来了，宝贝！

10:54.120 --> 10:55.085
Huh?
啊？

啊？